WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.084 --> 00:00:15.649
"It's time for our contest!"

2
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.150
the Battle Master said as the crowd cheered.

3
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:26.534
"It will be a four-way battle between Kid Comet, Rocket Girl, Sun Wukong, and the dragon!"

4
00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:29.975
Soon all four contestants stood in the arena.

5
00:00:30.835 --> 00:00:32.136
Wukong scratched his head.

6
00:00:32.636 --> 00:00:33.617
"What do we do now?

7
00:00:33.637 --> 00:00:35.497
I won't fight you guys."

8
00:00:36.438 --> 00:00:37.358
Sapphire snorted.

9
00:00:37.378 --> 00:00:39.399
"I won't either.

10
00:00:39.419 --> 00:00:42.200
I don't approve of this competition anyway."

11
00:00:43.021 --> 00:00:43.881
Roxy bit her lip.

12
00:00:43.901 --> 00:00:48.603
"I don't know She looked at Cozlin, who still seemed upset.

13
00:00:49.263 --> 00:00:50.304
Audience members shouted.

14
00:00:50.324 --> 00:00:52.345
"This is boring!"

15
00:00:52.365 --> 00:00:54.866
"I paid to see a real fight!"

16
00:00:55.526 --> 00:00:57.367
Wukong pulled out his iron bar.

17
00:00:57.387 --> 00:01:00.068
"Let's just pretend to fight."

18
00:01:00.884 --> 00:01:03.066
Roxy nodded and then shot her eye laser beams.

19
00:01:03.626 --> 00:01:06.149
Wukong pretended to be scared and jumped out of the way.

20
00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:08.711
Sapphire shot flames into the sky.

21
00:01:09.391 --> 00:01:11.373
Then Roxy saw Cozlin zip toward her.

22
00:01:12.294 --> 00:01:13.535
Was her friend going to attack?

23
00:01:13.975 --> 00:01:16.537
Roxy held up her fists, ready to defend herself.

24
00:01:17.218 --> 00:01:18.659
Cozlin gave her a funny look.

25
00:01:18.679 --> 00:01:22.823
"You don't really think I'm going to fight you, do you?"

26
00:01:23.563 --> 00:01:24.384
Roxy smiled.

27
00:01:24.404 --> 00:01:27.467
"I thought you were upset with me."

28
00:01:27.967 --> 00:01:28.848
Cozlin shrugged.

29
00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:32.498
"I was hurt, Roxy, but we're still friends."

30
00:01:32.518 --> 00:01:34.660
"This fight stinks!"

31
00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:35.981
someone yelled.

32
00:01:36.441 --> 00:01:37.602
The crowd began to boo.

33
00:01:38.803 --> 00:01:41.105
A fighter pounded on the wall of his cube.

34
00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:42.246
"Let me out!

35
00:01:42.626 --> 00:01:43.607
I'll fight those wimps!"

36
00:01:43.627 --> 00:01:46.329
"Yeah!" another fighter yelled.

37
00:01:46.349 --> 00:01:49.491
"I want that golden asteroid!"

38
00:01:50.311 --> 00:01:51.372
Roxy's watch beeped.

39
00:01:51.392 --> 00:01:54.855
"Terrell! What's going on?

40
00:01:54.915 --> 00:01:56.336
Is Metro City okay?"

41
00:01:57.012 --> 00:02:01.296
"We stopped the earthquakes, and the bodhisattva returned the gold," Terrell said.

42
00:02:01.316 --> 00:02:04.679
"Dr. Odd and I are here to help you escape!"

43
00:02:04.699 --> 00:02:07.201
"What?" Roxy cried.

44
00:02:07.221 --> 00:02:08.222
"You're here?"

45
00:02:08.242 --> 00:02:10.404
"Yes," Dr.

46
00:02:10.484 --> 00:02:11.004
Odd said.

47
00:02:11.024 --> 00:02:12.846
"But we can't get in.

48
00:02:13.807 --> 00:02:16.009
The stadium's surrounded by a force field.

49
00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:21.434
I hacked into the computer system, but there are hundreds of force fields.

50
00:02:22.154 --> 00:02:23.836
I don't know which one to turn off."

51
00:02:24.756 --> 00:02:26.837
Roxy looked at the other fighters in their cubes.

52
00:02:26.857 --> 00:02:29.558
"Hmm," she thought.

53
00:02:29.578 --> 00:02:32.379
"Every cube must be a force field."

54
00:02:33.179 --> 00:02:37.001
Suddenly several cubes vanished, and the fighters dropped to the ground.

55
00:02:37.021 --> 00:02:40.382
"I just disabled more force fields," Dr.

56
00:02:40.482 --> 00:02:40.983
Odd said.

57
00:02:41.003 --> 00:02:43.604
"But the stadium is still surrounded.

58
00:02:44.444 --> 00:02:45.524
I'll keep working on it."

59
00:02:45.544 --> 00:02:48.265
"Start fighting!"

60
00:02:49.106 --> 00:02:50.206
the Battle Master shouted.

61
00:02:50.226 --> 00:02:53.027
"We won't fight each other!"

62
00:02:53.468 --> 00:02:54.248
Cozlin yelled.

63
00:02:54.748 --> 00:02:57.570
"Yeah!" Wukong glared at the Battle Master.

64
00:02:57.590 --> 00:02:59.431
"I'll fight you though!"

65
00:03:00.132 --> 00:03:01.993
The Battle Master shouted at Wukong.

66
00:03:02.894 --> 00:03:05.055
As he did, more and more cubes vanished.

67
00:03:05.716 --> 00:03:08.458
There was now a big group of fighters on the stadium floor.

68
00:03:09.018 --> 00:03:10.599
A slug with wings stood tall.

69
00:03:10.619 --> 00:03:12.040
"I'll fight!"

70
00:03:12.521 --> 00:03:14.022
A frog flexed its muscles.

71
00:03:14.042 --> 00:03:15.463
"Me too!"

72
00:03:16.283 --> 00:03:17.824
The Battle Master looked startled.

73
00:03:17.844 --> 00:03:22.888
"How did you More fighters jumped to the ground as their cubes vanished.

74
00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.521
The Battle Master looked around frantically.

75
00:03:25.541 --> 00:03:27.122
"What's going on?

76
00:03:27.743 --> 00:03:29.284
What happened to your cubes?"

77
00:03:29.304 --> 00:03:31.365
"Who cares?"

78
00:03:31.786 --> 00:03:32.486
a blob said.

79
00:03:32.506 --> 00:03:35.588
"I just want that golden asteroid!"

80
00:03:35.608 --> 00:03:37.489
"No way!"

81
00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:38.810
Glytar said.

82
00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.772
"It's mine!"

83
00:03:40.792 --> 00:03:43.273
"That's what you think!"

84
00:03:43.834 --> 00:03:45.375
A green monster knocked him over.

85
00:03:46.055 --> 00:03:47.416
Soon there was a big brawl.

86
00:03:47.436 --> 00:03:51.139
"A a change of plans!"

87
00:03:51.639 --> 00:03:53.973
the Battle Master said, his voice shaking.

88
00:03:54.614 --> 00:03:58.036
He pressed a button on his palm, and every cube vanished.

89
00:03:58.056 --> 00:04:05.022
"We'll have a huge battle—the biggest battle anyone has ever seen!

90
00:04:05.923 --> 00:04:09.786
And there can be only one winner!"

91
00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:11.468
Roxy gulped.
